# Trust: Zeid II (hidden quest TrustZeidII): a level 99 Warrior in Norg. The door _700 (no script; default
# DOOR_IS_LOCKED); no permit asked for. RoV Volto Oscuro completed (setup). Every talk gives the cipher (the stopgap)
# and plays noAction; with a full inventory the giveItem fails (its message, no cipher). The cipher held:
# DOOR_IS_LOCKED.
lists Norg/_700/onTrigger
char zone=Norg pos=100.5,-8.55,-12 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Rov VoltoOscuro completed
login
fill-inventory
trigger _700                            # no room: giveItem fails; noAction
finish-if-event
free-inventory
trigger _700                            # the cipher; noAction
finish-if-event
trigger _700                            # the cipher held: DOOR_IS_LOCKED
finish-if-event
